@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+---
+id: task-002-record-task-timestamps
+type: task
+title: "Record task timestamps"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add ISO-8601 `createdAt` and `updatedAt` fields to every task. Both fields are equal when a task is
+created. Preserve `createdAt` and refresh `updatedAt` after each successful completion, reopening,
+rename, tag, or untag operation.
+
+The domain remains deterministic by receiving time from the public API boundary. Tests use a fixed
+timestamp provider to verify creation and all five update paths.
